# $showInheritanceTree(pClassRef)
# Opens the core Inheritance Tree window for pClassRef (core, undocumented,
# reverse engineered from IDE shell oLibraries.$cmenuclick Case 10).
#   $dotoolmethod(kEnvToolBrowser,6,classRef,kTrue) = Inheritance Tree
#   $dotoolmethod(kEnvToolBrowser,6,classRef)       = Interface Manager
# pClassRef: reference to a class (any classtype). No return value.
Do $root.$modes.$dotoolmethod(kEnvToolBrowser,6,pClassRef,kTrue) ## @CORE